  "term": "logical-mathematical intelligence",
  "definition": "Logical-mathematical intelligence is a type of intelligence included in a multiple-intelligences framework. In this study, higher logical-mathematical intelligence was associated with more positive attitudes toward scientific research and, through that, stronger motivation toward STEM.",
